beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_2 is similar to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_1

beta-Beryllene_full_top is similar to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow_1

beta-Beryllene_full_top-hollow_2 is equal to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_4

beta-Beryllene_full_top-top is equal to beta-Beryllene_full_hollow-hollow_1
